1

00:00:00,000  -->  00:00:03,440
How do we implement an agentic workflow?

2

00:00:03,440  -->  00:00:08,550
Well, at the heart of an agentic workflow are the agents themselves.

3

00:00:08,550  -->  00:00:13,740
Let's take a look at this little script that defines agents.

4

00:00:13,740  -->  00:00:20,640
As we know, agents are a piece of code that can execute work.

5

00:00:20,640  -->  00:00:23,710
They have access to knowledge,

6

00:00:23,710  -->  00:00:28,850
they have a persona and they might

7

00:00:28,850  -->  00:00:35,005
even be able to execute a task or return a piece of information.

8

00:00:35,005  -->  00:00:38,430
For our workflows, what we're going to do is,

9

00:00:38,430  -->  00:00:40,650
we're going to define different agents.

10

00:00:40,650  -->  00:00:44,650
In this case, I'm defining them as a class.

11

00:00:46,700  -->  00:00:53,665
Then I will define classes for each one of the types of agents.

12

00:00:53,665  -->  00:00:57,100
In this case, I have an agent that does research,

13

00:00:57,100  -->  00:01:03,630
an agent that summarizes and an agent that fact checks.

14

00:01:03,630  -->  00:01:08,220
You can start matching these different types of

15

00:01:08,220  -->  00:01:13,510
agents to the different possible agentic workflows.

16

00:01:13,510  -->  00:01:15,840
For each one of the agents,

17

00:01:15,840  -->  00:01:19,100
we define its knowledge as attributes,

18

00:01:19,100  -->  00:01:21,040
just like any other class,

19

00:01:21,040  -->  00:01:26,920
and then we define functions to run the agents themselves.

20

00:01:28,120  -->  00:01:31,420
Every agent will be a little bit different.

21

00:01:31,420  -->  00:01:36,100
Some agents will have a function and no attributes.

22

00:01:36,100  -->  00:01:41,040
The way that you define your agent really is up to you.

23

00:01:41,040  -->  00:01:47,430
The way that you use agents is what defines an agentic workflow.

24

00:01:47,430  -->  00:01:52,860
In this case, I define three agents, and for execution,

25

00:01:52,860  -->  00:01:59,520
what I'm doing is I'm running each of my agents step by step.
